      "comment": "SILENT MARK (1) recorded her Best Time this course and distance when a 30.04 winner of a Maiden in one of the quickest wins on the program. In form and rates on top again. RAD RIPPER (3) is a super consistent dog who rarely misses the frame, last start scoring at Mandurah (22.26), making it two straight wins. Strike rate this distance strong having won five of seven tries. Will go close here with a clear run. WEST ON MICKY (2) is worth forgiving last start after finishing sixth (30.96) in a Novice race at this track over 520m. Worth another chance. SUNSET CALIGULA (5) pinged the lids and wasn't headed last time. Sure to figure prominently.",
